codex
The validation inventory has two proof-local items only: the recursive `digitSumIS` definition and the machine-proved loop circularity. Neither rewrites or skips program execution. I’ve assembled `prove.sh` to rebuild both backends, rerun concrete and differential evidence, close the full positive spec, and require both negative probes to fail.
exec
/bin/bash -lc 'chmod +x prove.sh && ./prove.sh' in /workspace
